<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY FEB NET FOREIGN DEBT DOWN AT $12,754.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY FEB NET FOREIGN DEBT DOWN AT $12,754.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's net foreign debt dropped to $12,754.2 million in February from $12,835.7 million in January, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Tuesday in a statement.</p>
<p>    FIGURES IN $MILLION	    Feb 1997	  Jan 1997</p>
<p> Net foreign debt of Hungary     12,754.2	  12,835.7</p>
<p>International reserves and</p>
<p>   other foreign assets	    12,155.4	  12,720.1</p>
<p> Gross foreign debt		  24,440.8	  25,094.9</p>
<p>Net foreign debt of the</p>
<p>   government and the NBH	   7,354.4	   7,746.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Debt figures exclude inter-company loans.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
